Package: TMTMAKER
Title: Generate Randomized Trail Making Test (TMT) Stimuli
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Luiz Guilherme", "Curi", , "luizg.curi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates randomized Trail Making Test (TMT-A and TMT-B) stimulus
    sheets as PNG images. Supports configurable number of elements, minimum
    spacing, and 14 writing scripts including Latin, Greek, Arabic, Cyrillic,
    Hebrew, Armenian, Georgian, Hiragana, Katakana, Ethiopic, Devanagari,
    Thai, and Korean. Intended for researchers and clinicians who need multiple
    unique, reproducible versions of the TMT for neuropsychological assessment.
